<h2>Who We Are</h2>
<p>Palm Readings AI ("Palm Readings"," "we," "us," or "our") operates the Palm Readings AI website (palmreadings.ai) and related digital services (the "site" or "services"). Our goal is to provide a private, reflective, and accessible experience for individuals seeking insight, self-awareness, and perspective through digital palm readings and related tools.</p>
<p>Protecting your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and safeguarded when you visit or interact with our site. By using Palm Readings AI, you consent to the data practices described in this policy.</p>
<h2>Information Collection and Use</h2>
<p>In order to operate and improve our services, Palm Readings AI may collect personally identifiable information that you voluntarily provide, such as:</p>
<ul>
<li>Name</li>
<li>Email address</li>
<li>Uploaded photos</li>
<li>Any information you submit through forms, feedback, or direct communication</li>
</ul>
<p>We may also collect additional information when required to provide a service, respond to inquiries, or improve the accuracy and quality of our readings and tools.</p>
<p>Palm Readings AI does not collect personal information unless you voluntarily provide it. However, certain features or interactions may require you to share information, including but not limited to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Submitting a palm reading request</li>
<li>Providing feedback or survey responses</li>
<li>Contacting us through forms or email</li>
</ul>
<p>We may use the information you provide to communicate with you, deliver requested services, improve our offerings, and support internal research and development.</p>
<h2>Usage Data and Feedback</h2>
<p>We collect non-identifiable usage data to better understand how visitors interact with our site and services. This may include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Pages viewed</li>
<li>Time spent on the site</li>
<li>Interaction patterns</li>
<li>General usage trends</li>
</ul>
<p>We may also collect feedback you voluntarily submit, including qualitative responses, ratings, or comments. This data is used strictly to improve our tools, content, and user experience.</p>
<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>Information collected may be used for the following purposes:</p>
<ul>
<li>To personalize user experience and improve relevance</li>
<li>To improve site functionality, performance, and content</li>
<li>To respond to customer service requests and support needs</li>
<li>To analyze usage trends and optimize features</li>
<li>To communicate important updates or service-related messages</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>
<h2>Analytics and Tracking Technologies</h2>
<p>Palm Readings AI uses Google Analytics and similar tools to understand how users engage with the site. These tools may collect information such as IP address, browser type, device type, referring pages, and on-site behavior. This information is used for aggregate reporting and site optimization.</p>
<p>Google Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies. You can learn more about how Google uses data by visiting Google’s Privacy Policy.</p>
<h2>Automatically Collected Information</h2>
<p>Information about your device and browsing activity may be collected automatically, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>IP address</li>
<li>Browser type</li>
<li>Operating system</li>
<li>Access times</li>
<li>Referring website addresses</li>
</ul>
<p>This information helps us maintain service quality, monitor performance, and generate general usage statistics.</p>
<h2>Use of Cookies</h2>
<p>Palm Readings AI may use cookies to enhance your experience. Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help us recognize repeat visitors and understand usage patterns.</p>
<p>You can choose to accept or decline cookies through your browser settings. Declining cookies may limit certain features or functionality of the site.</p>
<h2>Sharing Information with Third Parties</h2>
<p>We may share data with trusted service providers who assist us with analytics, hosting, communications, or technical operations. These third parties are permitted to use information only as necessary to perform services on our behalf and are required to maintain confidentiality.</p>
<p>We may disclose information if required by law or in good faith belief that such action is necessary to comply with legal obligations, protect our rights or property, or ensure user safety.</p>
<h2>Links to Other Websites</h2>
<p>Our site may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.</p>
<h2>Security of Your Information</h2>
<p>We take reasonable and appropriate measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
<p>By using the site, you acknowledge and accept these inherent security risks.</p>
<h2>Your Access and Control Over Information</h2>
<p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Request access to the data we have about you</li>
<li>Request corrections or updates to your information</li>
<li>Request deletion of your information</li>
<li>Ask questions or raise concerns about our data practices</li>
</ul>
<h2>Children Under Thirteen</h2>
<p>Palm Readings AI does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under the age of thirteen. If you are under thirteen, please do not use this site or submit information without parental consent.</p>
<h2>Email Communications</h2>
<p>We may occasionally contact you via email regarding service updates, confirmations, feedback requests, or relevant information. You may opt out of non-essential communications at any time by following unsubscribe instructions or contacting us directly.</p>
<h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>Palm Readings AI reserves the right to update or modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Changes will be reflected on this page, and continued use of the site after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
<h2>Contact Information</h2>
<p>If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us through the website <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> or via email at <a href="mailto:hello@palmreadings.ai">hello@palmreadings.ai</a>.</p>
<p>By using this site, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to this Privacy Policy.</p>
